    "detailed_description": "Crime Scene - 3D puzzle game in which you have to clear the room of blood and other traces of the crime.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou have to play for an ordinary guy who does a specific job. Your work is connected with crime, blood and death.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPerform your job duties professionally removing all traces of the crime. Make sure all evidence is destroyed and the bodies are hidden.<br />\r\nPull yourself together and check if you really have nerves of steel, and get ready for the next task!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse different tools to get rid of evidence and blood, but be careful - the more time passes, the more dangerous the situation becomes. Can you complete the work on time?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features:<br />\r\n- Different difficulty levels<br />\r\n- Lots of challenging levels<br />\r\n- Beautiful graphics<br />\r\n- Pleasant music",
